      "id": "nc150-best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock",
      "front": "**Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock** · Easy\\n\\n[LeetCode](https://leetcode.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock/)\\n\\nChoose one day to buy and a later day to sell to maximize profit (or zero).\\n\\nPattern? Approach?",
      "back": "**Pattern:** Running minimum (sliding window)\\n\\n**Key insight:** Track the cheapest price so far; profit today = price - minSoFar.\\n\\n**Java**\\n\\n\`\`\`java\\nclass Solution {\\n    public int maxProfit(int[] prices) {\\n        int min = Integer.MAX_VALUE, best = 0;\\n        for (int p : prices) {\\n            min = Math.min(min, p);\\n            best = Math.max(best, p - min);\\n        }\\n        return best;\\n    }\\n}\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n**Python**\\n\\n\`\`\`python\\nclass Solution:\\n    def maxProfit(self, prices: List[int]) -> int:\\n        lo, best = float('inf'), 0\\n        for p in prices:\\n            lo = min(lo, p)\\n            best = max(best, p - lo)\\n        return best\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n**Time/Space:** O(n) / O(1)\\n\\n**Pitfall:** Max minus min overall is wrong — the sell must come after the buy.",
