      "id": "nc150-longest-substring-without-repeating-characters",
      "front": "**Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters** · Medium\\n\\n[LeetCode](https://leetcode.com/problems/longest-substring-without-repeating-characters/)\\n\\nFind the length of the longest stretch of a string in which no character repeats.\\n\\nPattern? Approach?",
      "back": "**Pattern:** Variable sliding window\\n\\n**Key insight:** Remember each char's last index; on repeat, jump left past it (never backwards).\\n\\n**Java**\\n\\n\`\`\`java\\nclass Solution {\\n    public int lengthOfLongestSubstring(String s) {\\n        Map<Character, Integer> last = new HashMap<>();\\n        int left = 0, best = 0;\\n        for (int r = 0; r < s.length(); r++) {\\n            Integer prev = last.put(s.charAt(r), r);\\n            if (prev != null && prev >= left) left = prev + 1;\\n            best = Math.max(best, r - left + 1);\\n        }\\n        return best;\\n    }\\n}\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n**Python**\\n\\n\`\`\`python\\nclass Solution:\\n    def lengthOfLongestSubstring(self, s: str) -> int:\\n        last = {}\\n        left = best = 0\\n        for r, ch in enumerate(s):\\n            if last.get(ch, -1) >= left:\\n                left = last[ch] + 1\\n            last[ch] = r\\n            best = max(best, r - left + 1)\\n        return best\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n**Time/Space:** O(n) / O(charset)\\n\\n**Pitfall:** Without the prev >= left check, left can move backwards (e.g. 'abba').",
