      "id": "nc150-network-delay-time",
      "front": "**Network Delay Time** · Medium\\n\\n[LeetCode](https://leetcode.com/problems/network-delay-time/)\\n\\nGiven weighted directed edges and a source node, find how long until a signal reaches every node, or -1 if some never get it.\\n\\nPattern? Approach?",
      "back": "**Pattern:** Dijkstra (single-source shortest paths)\\n\\n**Key insight:** Answer is the max shortest-path distance; any unreachable node means -1.\\n\\n**Java**\\n\\n\`\`\`java\\nclass Solution {\\n    public int networkDelayTime(int[][] times, int n, int k) {\\n        List<int[]>[] g = new List[n + 1];\\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) g[i] = new ArrayList<>();\\n        for (int[] t : times) g[t[0]].add(new int[]{t[1], t[2]});\\n        int[] dist = new int[n + 1];\\n        Arrays.fill(dist, Integer.MAX_VALUE);\\n        PriorityQueue<int[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>((a, b) -> a[1] - b[1]);\\n        pq.add(new int[]{k, 0});\\n        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\\n            int[] cur = pq.poll();\\n            if (dist[cur[0]] != Integer.MAX_VALUE) continue;\\n            dist[cur[0]] = cur[1];\\n            for (int[] e : g[cur[0]]) pq.add(new int[]{e[0], cur[1] + e[1]});\\n        }\\n        int ans = 0;\\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) ans = Math.max(ans, dist[i]);\\n        return ans == Integer.MAX_VALUE ? -1 : ans;\\n    }\\n}\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n**Python**\\n\\n\`\`\`python\\nimport heapq\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nfrom typing import List\\n\\nclass Solution:\\n    def networkDelayTime(self, times: List[List[int]], n: int, k: int) -> int:\\n        g = defaultdict(list)\\n        for u, v, w in times:\\n            g[u].append((v, w))\\n        dist = {}\\n        pq = [(0, k)]\\n        while pq:\\n            d, u = heapq.heappop(pq)\\n            if u in dist:\\n                continue\\n            dist[u] = d\\n            for v, w in g[u]:\\n                if v not in dist:\\n                    heapq.heappush(pq, (d + w, v))\\n        return max(dist.values()) if len(dist) == n else -1\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n**Time/Space:** O(E log E) / O(N + E)\\n\\n**Pitfall:** Nodes are 1-indexed; skip already-finalized nodes when popped.",
