      "id": "nc150-climbing-stairs",
      "front": "**Climbing Stairs** · Easy\\n\\n[LeetCode](https://leetcode.com/problems/climbing-stairs/)\\n\\nCount the distinct ways to climb n steps taking 1 or 2 steps at a time.\\n\\nPattern? Approach?",
      "back": "**Pattern:** Fibonacci-style DP\\n\\n**Key insight:** ways(n) = ways(n-1) + ways(n-2); keep just two variables.\\n\\n**Java**\\n\\n\`\`\`java\\nclass Solution {\\n    public int climbStairs(int n) {\\n        int a = 1, b = 1;\\n        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) { int c = a + b; a = b; b = c; }\\n        return b;\\n    }\\n}\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n**Python**\\n\\n\`\`\`python\\nclass Solution:\\n    def climbStairs(self, n: int) -> int:\\n        a = b = 1\\n        for _ in range(2, n + 1):\\n            a, b = b, a + b\\n        return b\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n**Time/Space:** O(n) / O(1)\\n\\n**Pitfall:** Off-by-one on base cases: ways(0)=1, ways(1)=1.",
